# AGENTS.md - gearness

> Entry point for AI coding agents. This file is a **map, not a manual**: keep it short and link to deeper docs.
> It is the single source of truth for all agent tools. Edit it here, then run `gearness sync`.

## Project
gearness is an open-source CLI that treats the harness around AI coding agents as code: it scaffolds AGENTS.md and context docs, lints them, scores them 0–100, keeps agent-specific files (CLAUDE.md, Cursor, Copilot) in sync, and records agent failures as durable guardrails (the ratchet). Must never break: `init` never destroys user content; `lint`/`doctor` exit codes are a public contract used by CI.

## Commands
A task is **not done** until `test` and `typecheck` pass.

| Purpose | Command |
|---|---|
| install | `npm ci` |
| build | `npm run build` |
| typecheck | `npm run typecheck` |
| test | `npm run test` |

